    "story": {
      "type": "00-aged-garlic-sales-story",
      "settings": {
        "why_eyebrow": "WHY PEOPLE CHOOSE AGED GARLIC",
        "why_heading": "Garlic made easier to live with.",
        "why_text": "<p>A familiar ingredient, reworked into a cleaner daily format. No chopping cloves. No strong garlic breath becoming part of the routine.</p>",
        "education_eyebrow": "AGED WITH PURPOSE",
        "education_heading": "Why age garlic in the first place?",
        "education_text": "<p>Fresh garlic is useful in food, but it is not always convenient as a daily supplement. Aged garlic is designed for a more consistent routine, especially when odor and preparation are the reasons people stop using ordinary garlic.</p>",
        "education_image_alt": "Avonent aged garlic softgels with garlic",
        "formula_eyebrow": "WHAT MAKES THIS FORMULA DIFFERENT",
        "formula_heading": "Aged garlic, paired with CoQ10 + ubiquinol.",
        "formula_text": "<p>Aged garlic is the foundation. CoQ10 + ubiquinol create the differentiating formula story. Exact ingredient amounts, serving size, and any SAC information should be added only after the final Supplement Facts are verified.</p>",
        "routine_eyebrow": "ONE SIMPLE ADDITION",
        "routine_heading": "Built to become the easy part of your day.",
        "routine_text": "No mixing powders. No garlic prep. Follow the verified label directions and make it part of a routine you can actually keep.",
        "compare_eyebrow": "A MORE CONSIDERED FORMAT",
        "compare_heading": "Avonent vs. ordinary garlic supplements",
        "guarantee_eyebrow": "TRY AVONENT FOR 30 DAYS",
        "guarantee_heading": "A simple guarantee. No fake urgency.",
        "guarantee_text": "<p>If Avonent is not right for you, contact us within 30 days and we will help with the next steps under our refund policy.</p>",
